<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT SWITZERLAND 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT SWITZERLAND 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PAU, France 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>France beat Switzerland 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in their European under-21 championship group 3 qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Thierry Henry 68</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
<p>    Group standings Pl  W  D  L   G  A Pts</p>
<p> Norway		  3  2  1  0  12  5  7</p>
<p> France		  3  2  1  0   4  1  7</p>
<p> Finland		 2  1  1  0   2  1  4</p>
<p> Switzerland	   3  0  1  2   4  9  1</p>
<p> Hungary		 3  0  0  3   1  7  0</p>
